worker-b logged no [E]/[W] at all. No rejected queries, crashes or retries needed.

Memory (docker stats, idle after test 1): worker-a1 212.7 MiB, worker-b 214.6 MiB (limit 7.75 GiB).
Surprising: nothing. The SCORE error (~5e-7) is FLOAT32 rounding on the 64-term sum, as expected.
